{"title": "RTI activist seeks probe into Dipke family finances, questions US education funding", "summary": "An RTI activist has filed a complaint with the Election Commission and tax authorities regarding CJP's status. The activist questioned how Bhagwanrao Dipke, founder of CJP, afforded his children's US education on his salary of Rs 60k. Complaints were also filed about a Rs 1 crore fund pledge.", "summary_points": ["An RTI activist has sought an investigation into Bhagwanrao Dipke's finances.", "Dipke's salary is Rs 60,000 per year.", "He questioned how his children could afford US education on this salary.", "Complaints were filed with the Election Commission and tax authorities regarding CJP's status."], "title_hi": "RTI कार्यकर्ता ने दीपके परित्यक्ति की संपत्ति की जांच मांगी, बेटों की अमेरिकी शिक्षा कैसे?", "summary_hi": "RTI एक्टिविस्ट ने चुनाव आयोग और कर विभाग से पत्र लिखकर दीपके परित्यक्ति की संपत्ति की जांच मांगी। उन्होंने पूछा कि कैसे भगवानराव दीपके ने अपने बेटों को अमेरिकी विश्वविद्यालय में शिक्षा दिलाई.", "summary_points_hi": ["RTI एक्टिविस्ट ने दीपके परित्यक्ति की संपत्ति की जांच मांगी।", "दीपके की वार्षिक तनख्वाह 60 हजार रुपये है।", "उन्होंने पूछा कि उनके बेटों को अमेरिकी शिक्षा कैसे दिलाई गई।", "चुनाव आयोग और कर विभाग से पत्र लिखकर दीपके परित्यक्ति की संपत्ति की जांच मांगी।"], "framing": {}, "framing_hi": {}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/news/national/pp9soz/article71295800.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/CJP_Artx.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "India Today", "owner": "India Today Group", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Cannot forget his sacrifice: Abhijeet Dipke junks CJP-Sonam Wangchuk divide buzz"}, {"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/abhijeet-dipke-ashutosh-ranka-and-saurav-das-the-three-faces-of-a-revolt/article71295809.ece", "headline": "Abhijeet Dipke